WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:05.070
Whether they cut their teeth on the franchise
or added it to an already impressive resume,

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:08.380
what does the cast of Star Wars do after The
Rise of Skywalker?

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.629
We're here to find out.

00:00:09.629 --> 00:00:13.159
Here's where you'll be able to find the stars
of the sequel trilogy after they leave that

00:00:13.159 --> 00:00:15.559
galaxy far, far away.

00:00:15.559 --> 00:00:19.920
Daisy Ridley was virtually unknown, with only
a handful of short film and TV credits to

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:23.320
her name, when she was cast as Rey in Star
Wars: The Force Awakens.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:28.039
When the film was released in 2015, she became
an international star, opening a world of

00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:30.289
new acting opportunities overnight.

00:00:30.289 --> 00:00:34.859
With Episode IX completing Rey's on-screen
arc, Ridley will be free of certain film franchise

00:00:34.859 --> 00:00:38.929
constraints, but she hasn't lined up a huge
number of projects just yet.

00:00:38.929 --> 00:00:42.929
Even before she jumped into finishing Rise
of Skywalker she worked alongside Tom Holland

00:00:42.929 --> 00:00:47.630
on Chaos Walking, a film that's been subjected
to repeated reshoots and, at the moment, does

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:48.860
not have a release date.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:49.860
"Hey Daisy!

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.050
Does Rey go to the Dark Side?”

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.050
"Tom!

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:53.050
Come on!"

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:54.390
Still, that hasn't slowed Ridley down.

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:59.069
Among her announced post-Skywalker plans are
the World War II drama A Woman of No Importance,

00:00:59.069 --> 00:01:03.379
in which she'll play spy Virginia Hall, and
the supernatural film Kolma, which has been

00:01:03.379 --> 00:01:08.180
in the works for several years and is rumored
to be part of the Cloverfield universe.

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:12.320
John Boyega was a bit better known than Daisy
Ridley when he signed on to play Finn in Star

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:16.040
Wars: The Force Awakens, because he'd already
been a part of one of the great cult films

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:19.010
of the 2010s: Attack the Block.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:22.990
Since Star Wars entered his life, though,
Boyega's star has continued to rise.

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:26.950
Like Ridley, Boyega hasn't lined up a great
many projects following the conclusion of

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:30.670
his Star Wars trilogy, but what he does have
coming up sounds compelling.

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:34.810
His next film will be Naked Singularity, in
which he plays a public defender whose life

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:39.530
begins to unravel and who, at his wit's end,
decides to carry out a heist.

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:43.870
He's also set to appear in the upcoming British
miniseries Small Axe.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:48.400
Oscar Isaac's career had already spanned more
than a decade and included an impressive series

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.860
of diverse and compelling roles by the time
Star Wars entered his life.

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:56.250
His accomplishments before a galaxy far, far
away included the likes of A Most Violent

00:01:56.250 --> 00:02:01.440
Year, Sucker Punch, and Inside Llewyn Davis,
for which he was nominated for a Golden Globe.

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:05.340
After The Rise of Skywalker, Isaac will continue
to build on his already-impressive resume

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:09.550
with several projects, including another legendary
sci-fi story.

00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:14.290
In 2020, Isaac will appear in director Denis
Villenueve's upcoming big-screen adaptation

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:17.850
of Dune, adding another major franchise to
his filmography.

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:23.190
His other upcoming films including the drama
Big Gold Brick and the thriller The Card Counter.

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:28.050
Prior to Star Wars, Adam Driver was best known
for his role as Adam on Lena Dunham's HBO

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:29.050
series Girls.

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:33.260
Somehow, that and his rising reputation as
a dramatic actor on the indie scene were enough

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:37.140
to secure him the role of the franchise's
new primary villain, Kylo Ren.

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:41.670
"I feel like he feels like he's in the right,
so what is there to be redeemed from?'

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:46.040
The role brought Driver international superstardom,
but he has continued to interweave small dramatic

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:50.950
roles with his franchise blockbusters, establishing
himself as one of his generation's boldest

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:51.950
actors.

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:55.890
Driver's career since his Star Wars role began
has already been quite exciting, and he's

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:58.060
not slowing down anytime soon.

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:02.380
His new Netflix drama Marriage Story was released
shortly before The Rise of Skywalker, and

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:06.760
his upcoming projects include the musical
drama Annette and Ridley Scott's next historical

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:08.360
epic, The Last Duel.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:13.330
Domhnall Gleeson's career included a major
franchise well before Star Wars came along.

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:17.580
As his reputation grew in the early 2010s
he earned a role in the Harry Potter film

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:19.400
series as Bill Weasley.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:23.100
When Star Wars: The Force Awakens needed a
secondary villain in the form of First Order

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:28.080
General Hux, director J.J. Abrams went with
Gleeson, cementing his place in another iconic

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.240
franchise.

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:33.630
After Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker, he'll
next be seen in Peter Rabbit 2: The Runaway,

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:37.440
in which he reprises his dual roles as Jeremy
Fisher and Thomas McGregor.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:41.080
He's also set to make a major play for the
small screen with a new comedic thriller on

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.360
HBO called Run.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:47.120
Star Wars: The Force Awakens had to introduce
a number of new characters to the world of

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:51.410
a galaxy far, far away, and make a worldwide
audience fall in love with them.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:55.690
Star Wars: The Last Jedi had to build on that
new foundation, and to do that writer/director

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:58.310
Rian Johnson turned to Kelly Marie Tran.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:02.550
At the time, Tran was relatively unknown,
with a resume consisting largely of small

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.650
TV roles.

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:08.069
As Resistance mechanic Rose Tico in The Last
Jedi, she reached an international level of

00:04:08.069 --> 00:04:09.069
fame.

00:04:09.069 --> 00:04:12.890
So far, Tran's kept a relatively low profile
outside of Star Wars, with her only other

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:17.310
major work coming in the form of the Facebook
Watch series Sorry for Your Loss with Elizabeth

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:21.680
Olsen, but that's set to change soon with
a pair of high-profile voiceover roles.

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:25.780
"Because it feels like it was a big franchise,
now I just want to do something totally different

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:26.960
and weird."

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:31.460
In the wake of The Rise of Skywalker, she's
set to co-star in The Croods 2 as Dawn, and

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:36.160
she'll also be joining Pixar's Monsters Inc.
franchise with a role in the upcoming Disney+

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.400
series Monsters At Work.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.760
Mark Hamill could have stopped acting after
Return of the Jedi and he would have remained

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:46.270
a legendary pop culture figure forever thanks
to his portrayal of Luke Skywalker.

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:50.700
Thankfully, he did not stop, and the result
is a diverse career that's included many screen

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:53.690
acting roles and perhaps even more voiceover
roles.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:58.480
In 2015, Hamill was drafted to return to the
Star Wars saga as Luke Skywalker, ushering

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.590
in a new phase of his career that has only
gained steam since.

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:02.889
So, what's next for Hamill?

00:05:02.889 --> 00:05:07.800
Well, he could conceivably never stop playing
Luke Skywalker in various forms, but for the

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:10.420
moment he's turning to a new animation project.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:15.100
Hamill has been cast as one of the voice actors
in the upcoming series Invincible, an adult-oriented

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:19.740
superhero series based on the Skybound Entertainment
comic of the same name, written by Walking

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:22.070
Dead co-creator Robert Kirkman.

